<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's  Icatu Hartford 1996 net vs loss.</title>
<headline>Brazil's  Icatu Hartford 1996 net vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian insurance company Icatu Hartford Seguros SA issued the following statement on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>			1996			 1995</p>
<p>    shr	profit 0.13 reais	  loss 0.68</p>
<p>    net	profit 619,000	     loss 2.2 million</p>
<p>    premiums	  98.4 million	    71.1 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais. Share profit figures provided in lots of 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>Icatu Hartford Seguros, specialized in life insurance and pension plans, is a joint-venture between Brazilian insurance company Icatu and U.S. insurer ITT Hartford Group Inc.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
